title: AWS v2 ELB: HTTP ELB
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the number of HTTP 4XX and 5XX server errors
 returned by the AWS/ELB instance during the selected time period (sum).

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {{Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}}.

 No default levels are set, but upper levels can be configured.

discovery:
 One service is created if the required metric RequestCount is given.
